{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"8033f41660b5a48d431a3df2ae5dc6c0902960188d4457f531edeb2293f037b5","ja":"育の新作！卵料理","zh":"育的新作！鸡蛋料理","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f068baca35effc8e7a397f08e7c5bab72c236d00162f965e4a9fbfb0a8f4bdab","ja":"美奈子さん、わたしたちもやってみようよ。\n大人なら、スポーツしながらお料理できるんだよね？","zh":"美奈子，我们也试试吧。\n大人的话，可以一边运动一边做菜吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3d3231abd50d5e03d11b0ab047aba9e0b945a516393409ff8acf0823ee8928c4","ja":"う、うーん。それは人によるかもだけど……\nまあせっかくだし、やってみよっか？","zh":"唔、嗯……这个可能因人而异吧……\n不过既然难得，要不要试试看？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"77102e89ef9446e074f19abe3ae50fd4d1644934151550a6187a6828fafd98a1","ja":"うん！　わたしね、だしまき卵にちょうせん\nしたいの！　合わせるスポーツは何がいいかな？","zh":"嗯！我呀，想要挑战做厚蛋烧！搭配什么运动","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"380994f46f7bdb269b1c1225c2a37a9035f7e787b309e87de62f5f63cc6057c1","ja":"そうだね～。ランニングとかはどうかな？","zh":"是啊～。去跑步怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a4c50fd7a6e7e5ca8abb7073e130b7a85d5c8145cabeec50f07997ed163684a5","ja":"わかった！　じゃあ走ろう！　その場を動かないで\n走ればいいよね！　じゃあ、スタート！","zh":"好！　那就跑吧！　别离开原地\n跑起来就好了！　那么，开始！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"eb6964527eca6048d94cca882d06a86c166b8b031b8dca8de698c56417f73325","ja":"……ぜえ、はあ。つ、次は、た、卵……。\nさいばしで、かきまぜて……。","zh":"……呼、哈。接、接下来是，鸡、鸡蛋……。\n用筷子搅拌……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"ee4945bc28705f42518a452ff4266bcaeefb69ed116bfa94c6a1a2d531bbab79","ja":"……いいよ、いいよ育ちゃん！　さすがだね！\nぜえ、はあ。そして次は、クルッとまとめて……。","zh":"……好棒好棒，小育！真厉害啊！\n呼、哈。接下来，咕噜地转一圈收尾……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"f9b6ab613bd57f15cb121fcefbd0cdbcac42c74b31e34057542dc55d2308c06e","ja":"はあ、はあ……クルッ……。","zh":"哈啊、哈啊……咕噜噜……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"01a47e031bc99d506f32131a7d20b81f92f9a9e5b084c13db2820efb7dc9fc1f","ja":"……で、できたー！","zh":"……然后，完成啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e218791ce4029d5a5d0a0f74b5048ba582dd5072e70c331a9d8614706989d6bc","ja":"さすが育ちゃん！　美味しそうにできたね！\n……走りながらでも結構やれるもんだな……。","zh":"不愧是小育！　看起来很好吃呢！\n……没想到边跑边做也能做得挺好呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_944.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"325ac51a3e73e8a54575462700b67042414409285507a52d978b744af4330331","ja":"（ま、まずいぞ。育と美奈子はスポーツも料理も\n上手にできてる！　こ、こうなったら……！）","zh":"（糟、糟糕了。育和美奈子运动和料理都\n很拿手！　这、这样的话……！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
